@@ -1,3 +1,10 @@
+## Unreleased
+
+- Shell completion no longer drops arguments after a `#` character. A
+  `#` at the start of an argument was treated as a shell comment when
+  splitting the command line, so `split_arg_string("cli a #b")` returned
+  `["cli", "a"]`.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
